LOCUS       sequence-405844-        9454 bp    DNA     circular SYN 04-SEP-2026
DEFINITION  For inserting a phiC31 attP site. HDR integrant is marked with 
            removable 3XP3-DsRed cassette, which is expressed in eyes. DsRed 
            difficult to see in wild type eyes if using LeicaM165 FC 
            microscope..
